Subject: Cantor Primal Scribe Refiner Identity Assessment

Description: Architecture assessment of the proposition that Cantor is the logical process of Scribe plus Refiner, articulated through its own primal form. It finds the proposition strongly compatible when Scribe and Refiner name primitive semantic poles rather than making Cantor depend circularly on two compiled faculty programs.

